{"reviewId": "429127097_86SosDCDL", "review": {"abstract": "5)房地产周期的低点大致会滞后于中周期低点，由于2019—2020年可能是美国中周期低点，因此本轮房地产周期的终极大底可能出现在2020年之后，即在2020—2025年见底。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "chapterUid": 17, "content": "周金涛的康波周期论受货币政策的扰动是很大的，起码在美国房价这个问题上，判断是偏离很大的。比如2012后到目前基本上房价是一直上涨的。要理性的看这一点。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "15399-15486", "createTime": 1770940155, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 17, "reviewId": "429127097_86SosDCDL", "userVid": 429127097, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 429127097, "name": "霜之秋华", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lKwuzv6xxHP50Vuia5aYLdam9zQXucuic0WvgzCmbxZScD9jVriatLTtDOxGTgYqf7iaCkkP1FPPh024VgQKHVmsKQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-500", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 72513280, "name": "柳卿云", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4dPnKkhibKYJy3cW8UbhbtBDnZYsYgUj2wChL8yUfuPnw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-100", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你说的对，尤其疫情